Package: corpus-querier
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Predrag Kovačević
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxft2, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxcb1, zlib1g
Description: Desktop CQL research tool for CLARIN.SI
 Corpus Querier calculates total CQL frequencies, extracts matched word forms
 and reports form frequencies. It processes existing CQL spreadsheets or
 generates queries from words and reusable WORD or LEMMA templates.
